<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Scan Source — API AC Scanner</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand"><span class="logo">⛨</span><span class="brand-text">api-<b>ac</b>-scanner</span></div>
    <nav class="nav"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/scan/source">Scan Source</a><a href="/scan/domain">Scan Domain</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main class="container narrow">
    <h1>Scan source code</h1>
    <p class="sub">Upload a folder or files. We statically analyze for access-control anti-patterns
      (BOLA, Mass Assignment) across Node/Express, Python, PHP and Java. After the scan you can
      preview a fix and apply it to your copy.</p>

    <form action="/scan/source/run" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form">
      <label class="field">
        <span class="field-label">Source files / folder</span>
        <input type="file" name="sources" multiple webkitdirectory directory />
        <span class="hint">Select a directory (Chrome/Edge) or multiple files.</span>
      </label>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Run source scan</button>
    </form>
  </main>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
